{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-lp-stable","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:lp-stable","kind":"definition","title":"LP-stable element of $H_3(q)$","tags":["lp-stability","gram-matrix","confinement","hecke-algebra"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPStable","text":"lp-stable.md","leanSource":"lp-stable.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:lp-stable\"></a><p><em>An element <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x \\in H_3(q)</code> with NF decomposition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x = \\sum_{i=1}^{6} x_i b_i</code> is <strong>LP-stable</strong> if <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Gx \\geq 0</code> (component-wise), where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G</code> is the Gram matrix <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G_{ij} = \\mathrm{tr}_M(b_i \\cdot b_j)</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-stable.md","heading":"Definition","number":"14.2.21","page":"b/def-lp-stable","qa":{"counts":{"pass":77,"fail":2,"warn":0,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":63},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPStable","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-stable.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
